{"ticker":"GEN","updated":"2026-10-23T23:01:38Z","profile":{"longName":"Gen Digital Inc.","shortName":"Gen Digital Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.gendigital.com","fullTimeEmployees":3900,"marketCap":14892844032,"trailingPE":14.549706,"forwardPE":7.497883,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.9322393,"pegRatio":1.28,"targetMeanPrice":31.775,"targetHighPrice":46.0,"targetLowPrice":24.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.063,"earningsGrowth":0.64,"grossMargins":0.78007007,"operatingMargins":0.35554,"profitMargins":0.20732,"totalRevenue":5079000064,"beta":1.257,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":31.65,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":17.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.01},"summary":"Gen Digital Inc. engages in the provision of cyber safety and trust-based solutions for individuals, families, and small businesses. The company offers security and performance management, identity protection, and online privacy, as well as technology platforms. It also provides restoration support services, digital reputation, and secure financial wellness. The company offers its products under the Norton, Avast, LifeLock, MoneyLion, Avira, AVG, ReputationDefender, and CCleaner brands. The company was formerly known as NortonLifeLock Inc. and changed its name to Gen Digital Inc. in November 2022. Gen Digital Inc. was founded in 1982 and is headquartered in Tempe, Arizona.","summary_zh":"Gen Digital Inc. 致力於為個人、家庭和小型企業提供網路安全和基於信任的解決方案。該公司提供安全和效能管理、身分保護、線上隱私以及技術平台。它還提供恢復支援服務、數位聲譽和安全的財務健康。該公司以 Norton、Avast、LifeLock、MoneyLion、Avira、AVG、ReputationDefender 和 CCleaner 品牌提供產品。該公司前身為 NortonLifeLock Inc.，於 2022 年 11 月更名為 Gen Digital Inc.。 Gen Digital Inc. 成立於 1982 年，總部位於亞利桑那州坦佩。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":31.57,"h":31.57,"l":31.11,"c":31.13,"v":3355900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":31.04,"h":31.13,"l":30.5,"c":30.77,"v":5737300},